                "recommended": "<strong>Recomendados:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo:</strong> Do you even read these I mean come on<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Lupinball doesn't need the latest hardware<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 11<br></li><li><strong>Rede:</strong> Ligação à Internet de banda larga</li></ul>"
